(7526741, 1202962, 22288, '<td valign="top">First, I love rabbits and this one is very cute, but it seems a bit out of focus, not sure if its the monochromatic color that makes it seem that way. I think I would also enjoy the photo more if there was less grass, maybe a tighter crop on the rabbit.</td>', 'First, I love rabbits and this one is very cute, but it seems a bit out of focus, not sure if its the monochromatic color that makes it seem that way. I think I would also enjoy the photo more if there was less grass, maybe a tighter crop on the rabbit.', '2017-08-02 14:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7526742, 1203179, 22288, '<td valign="top">Would the title before licking the lens be better for this challenge? That said the idea is nice, but with so little in focus it just distracts from the photo completely. The reflection in the eye is interesting, but not enough to overcome the blurring. Maybe a bit more focus would have given it more punch.</td>', 'Would the title before licking the lens be better for this challenge? That said the idea is nice, but with so little in focus it just distracts from the photo completely. The reflection in the eye is interesting, but not enough to overcome the blurring. Maybe a bit more focus would have given it more punch.', '2017-08-02 14:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
